All 15 tests pass now.

**What was fixed:**

- `src/auth.py:7` — `has_permission` now compares roles case-insensitively.
- `src/auth.py:16` — `is_admin_or_owner` changed from `and` to `or` so either condition grants access.
- `src/inventory.py:14` — eliminated the mutable-default dict bug by copying `initial` when provided.
- `src/inventory.py:19` — `add` accumulates stock instead of overwriting it.
- `src/inventory.py:28` — `reserve` allows reserving exactly the available amount (`>` instead of `>=`).
- `src/inventory.py:37` — `release` raises `ValueError` when releasing more than was reserved.
- `src/text_utils.py:14` — `slugify` lowercases characters and collapses repeated separators in a single pass.
- `src/text_utils.py:33` — `truncate` subtracts the suffix length from the slice so the total length respects `max_len`.
